      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CARRY ON MACI (5) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 8 length win at Angle Park in a handy 19.04. Jumping from the pinch draw but has a good record over this journey. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. In sparkling form and expected to measure up again. PAW MANTRA (1) could not have been more impressive a few runs back in his speedy 19.67 win at Angle Park over 342m then has finished in the placings in both runs since. Top win three back and can measure up again. BINNAWAY WIZARD (2) was in the minors two back (19.90) at Angle Park but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Has a good record here at this journey. Likely to be about the money. WEBLEC SNIP (8) placed last start at this track and distance and is in the mix again.",
